l, Edwards could count five Olympic medals, four of them gold, after the Americans easily won the 2000 gold medal.  The United States was undefeated in Sydney, winning a preliminary game against Russia, 88-77, in their closest game of the tournament.  In the final, they defeated the hometown Aussies, 76-54.  After the final game ended, Teresa Edwards went to mid-court by herself, and sat down at the center circle, absorbing the final moments of her Olympic experience."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button876471", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button876471').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Scoring Average"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Time Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Disqualifications"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title